# SOP Lang of the scene "Underwater reef" (docs/js/scenes-extra.js, id reef), one block per message.
# Generation model: Claude Opus 5.5 (claude-opus-5-5), 2026-11-04. Format and rules: ../CONVENTIONS.md.

## turn 1
# input: Clear the canvas
@m1 mention quantifier=all
@c1 command action=delete target=$m1

## turn 2
# input: Underwater reef. A light blue rectangle as the background, 780 by 480, at 400,250, call it Water.
@c1 command action=create shape=rectangle color=blue fill=light layer=background width=780 height=480 at=400,250 name=Water

## turn 3
# input: hmm, more turquoise. change Water to teal
@c1 command action=set target=Water color=teal

## turn 4
# input: sand along the bottom: light yellow rectangle zone, 780 wide, 90 tall, at 400,445, named Sand
@c1 command action=create shape=rectangle color=yellow fill=light layer=zone width=780 height=90 at=400,445 name=Sand

## turn 5
# input: Our fish is called Finn. Medium orange oval at 300,200, name it FinnBody.
#! note: "Our fish is called Finn" names the fish as a whole: the group of message 8; the oval itself is FinnBody
@c1 command action=create shape=ellipse size=medium color=orange at=300,200 name=FinnBody

## turn 6
# input: tail: small orange triangle at 232,200, Tail
@c1 command action=create shape=triangle size=small color=orange at=232,200 name=Tail

## turn 7
# input: a tiny black circle named Eye at 322,190
@c1 command action=create shape=circle size=tiny color=black name=Eye at=322,190

## turn 8
# input: group FinnBody, Tail and Eye into Finn
@c1 command action=group target=FinnBody,Tail,Eye name=Finn

## turn 9
# input: Jellyfish up top: medium purple circle at 620,110, named Jelly.
@c1 command action=create shape=circle size=medium color=purple at=620,110 name=Jelly

## turn 10
# input: Under it, 5 px below Jelly, put three tiny purple triangles in a row for the tentacles.
@c1 command action=create count=3 shape=triangle size=tiny color=purple layout=row position=below anchor=Jelly distance=5

## turn 11
# input: Group Jelly and those three triangles as Jellyfish.
#! resolved: "those three triangles" -> every tiny purple triangle: the three tentacles of the previous message
@m1 mention quantifier=all shape=triangle size=tiny color=purple
@c1 command action=group target=Jelly,$m1 name=Jellyfish

## turn 12
# input: Can you make Finn a friend? Duplicate Finn.
@c1 command action=duplicate target=Finn

## turn 13
# input: move the copy down 110 pixels
#! resolved: "the copy" -> Finn2: a copied group is a new group named after the original with a 2 (the reply of message 12 says so, and message 14 calls it Finn2)
